reasons:
  design.clocks.clk_sys: "The prompt specifies the Nexys A7-100T and the answered default selects its 100 MHz onboard oscillator."
  design.clocks.clk_pix: "The required pixel frequency is specified, and the answered default selects the onboard 100 MHz oscillator as its source; MMCM implementation details are proposed."
  design.resets.rst_sys: "A board reset source is needed; CPU_RESETN is the available active-low reset pin. The prompt does not otherwise specify reset behavior."
  design.resets.rst_pix: "The pixel-domain reset is derived from the system reset and synchronized into the pixel-clock domain."
  design.shell.design_id: "The specification explicitly gives the four-character identifier VMED."
  design.modules.video_control.window_base: "The shell window is 0x80-0xFF; choose its first address as the base and place the module's offsets at 0x00 and 0x04."
  video_timing.contract.clocks.clk.max_mhz: "Set the contract limit to the specified pixel-clock rate."
  video_timing.contract.resets.rst: "Use a synchronous active-high reset in the pixel-clock domain; reset style and polarity are not specified."
  color_bars.contract.clocks.clk.max_mhz: "The bar generator runs at the specified pixel rate."
  color_bars.contract.resets.rst: "Use the shared synchronous active-high pixel-domain reset; reset style and polarity are not specified."
  median_filter.contract.clocks.clk.max_mhz: "The filter runs at the specified pixel rate."
  median_filter.contract.resets.rst: "Use the shared synchronous active-high pixel-domain reset; reset style and polarity are not specified."
  frame_counter.contract.clocks.clk.max_mhz: "The frame counter runs at the pixel rate to count video frame boundaries."
  frame_counter.contract.resets.rst: "Use the shared synchronous active-high pixel-domain reset; reset style and polarity are not specified."
  video_cdc.contract.clocks.clk_sys.max_mhz: "The shell is assigned the 100 MHz board oscillator."
  video_cdc.contract.clocks.clk_pix.max_mhz: "The CDC connects to the specified 74.25 MHz pixel domain."
  video_cdc.contract.resets.rst_sys: "Use the system-domain reset."
  video_cdc.contract.resets.rst_pix: "Use the pixel-domain reset."
  video_control.contract.clocks.clk.max_mhz: "The register window belongs to the USB-UART shell clock domain."
  video_control.contract.resets.rst: "Use the shell's system-domain reset; polarity and style are proposed consistently for the project."
